---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/';
const target = `${base.endsWith('/') ? base : `${base}/`}xizong/circulation/b01/`;
---
<main>
  <p>此旧入口已收敛到当前西综 Runtime。<a href={target}>继续到 B1 · 正常机械循环</a></p>
</main>
<script is:inline define:vars={{ target }}>
  window.location.replace(target);
</script>
